-- Japanese tokenizer skin (ex40): two readers, one token stream, one statement. Twin of 40-tokenizer-skin.bqn.
-- The JA line lexes through the registry ja aliases and the particle table, drops the fused に TGT marker, and re-roots each postfix operator; same-tokens pins the .bqn's kind-stream equality against the ASCII line.
--! registry 40-tokenizer-skin
--! ja
--! same-tokens Nord & TwoHanded > 60 , Gold += 1000
--! expect gold = 1100 100 100 1100 100 100

北 と 両手 六十 より 、 金 に 千 たす
